      "content": "it's not just depression. it's like the reality is that i'm done. people don't just \"unhear\" you, they actively choose to look through you. i see them talking, laughing, and then they see me and it's like they're looking at a blank wall. there's no \"friend\" or \"counselor\" that fixes the fact that my place in the world is just... gone. there's nothing left to save.",
